# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Order (0.4.3 fix round): from Moonglade's flight to Rut'theran Village and Darnassus (Erelas, Fandral and
# Mathrengyl), the flight to Auberdine and the boat, Ironforge, then the Plaguelands in one sweep at 55-56:
# Chillwind Camp and Felstone Field, Darrowshire, the Marris Stead and Light's Hope Chapel, the farms and cauldrons,
# Andorhal and Chromie, Northridge (Kirsta's Radley, Durgen and the Hearthglen overlook), Tirion, Gahrron's Withering,
# the Plaguewood and Terrordale, and back to Chillwind Camp, with a flight to Stormwind and back in the middle for
# Bolvar's errand from level 56; Stormwind last, on the way to the boat for Theramore and Mount Hyjal. The
# Plaguelands used to be four separate trips (51.7, 55.6, 55.7-56.5 and 59.9-60).
# Fix pass 2026-11-20: Rabine Saturna (6762, from Mathrengyl) takes her letter on Mount Hyjal's Moonglade errand, so
# the guide no longer flies Rut'theran -> Moonglade -> Auberdine for her (all three flights run by way of Auberdine:
# about 8,500 yards of flight and Nighthaven's walk less); a character who loads this guide without the Burning
# Steppes guide's Chillwind quests gets their first parts (5090, 5092, 5215) on its own Ironforge and Chillwind stops.
# Left out: Felstone Field Cauldron (5218), Dalson's Tears Cauldron (5221), Writhing Haunt Cauldron (5224).
# Left out: Glyphed Oaken Branch (4986: for Darnassus, which the route has left), Mold Rhymes With... (5538: Gadgetzan
# and Un'Goro are behind the route), the termite barrel at Northridge (5904: Dumah gives it after the Plaguewood's
# termites, with Northridge behind the route by then), Good Luck Charm (5050: back to Janice from Stormwind), Hameya's
# Plea (6024: Infiltrator Hameya is level 60), Defenders of Darrowshire (5211: Corin's Crossing's Scourge are 57-60).
# Davil's Libram (Heroes of Darrowshire, 5168): the town hall's Scarlet Paladins are 55-56 elites, with elite priests
# and two level 63 High Clerists: a group step.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Teldrassil, Darnassus and Moonglade

step Fly to Rut'theran Village
  skipto chillwind when !onquest 978,3461,4512,5216,5245,6028,6030,96812
  tip The Darnassus, Moonglade and Ironforge stops are for players coming from the previous guides with their quests; opened with none of those quests in the log, the guide starts at Chillwind Camp.
  zone Moonglade
  fly "Rut'theran Village"
  zone Teldrassil

step Rut'theran Village
  zone Teldrassil
  when complete 978
  tip The flight lands in Rut'theran Village. Erelas Ambersky stands a short walk north-west of the flight master.
  turnin 978                          -- Erelas Ambersky
  note Erelas' next task sends you back to Ranshalla in Winterspring, behind the route now: skip it.

