# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Plaguewood and Terrordale

step Aurora Skycaller
  when complete 5245
  tip Ride north-west to Quel'Lithien Lodge, at the edge of the Plaguewood.
  turnin 5245

step Plaguewood: kill these as you meet them
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip West through the Plaguewood to Terrordale: fill the Empty Termite Jar at the big termite mounds, and kill the Frenzied Plaguehounds and the Carrion Devourers on the way.
  tip Careful: the Frenzied Plaguehounds are 57-58: pull them one at a time.
  collect 15043 quest 5903.1          -- Plagueland Termites
  kill 8598 quest 5542.3              -- Frenzied Plaguehound
  collect 13853 quest 5544.1          -- Slab of Carrion Worm Meat

step Augustus the Touched
  tip Augustus lives in the ruined hut in Terrordale, and his receipt book lies in the ruined inn nearby. Egan stands by Augustus' hut.
  tip Careful: a Nerubian Overseer (60, elite) walks Terrordale and the Terrorweb Tunnel south-west of it. Look for him before you ride in, and wait for him to pass.
  accept 6164                         -- Inside
  turnin 5281                         -- Egan

step Augustus the Touched
  collect 15884 quest 6164.1 @14.0,24.2 map 1423 live -- Upstairs
  turnin 6164                         -- Inside

step Tirion Fordring
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Cross the river west to Tirion's hut.
  tip Careful: the short way from Terrordale to Tirion is the Terrorweb Tunnel, whose south mouth opens by his hut: Crypt Fiends, Walkers, Horrors and Slayers (53-58) stand close together inside. Pull them one at a time, or ride round by the road outside it.
  turnin 5543
  turnin 5544
  turnin 5542
  accept 5742

