  tip Cross the river south-east to the Undercroft, the crypt in the south-west of the zone.
  tip Careful: About four non-elite adds come with Mercutio. They walk to the grave instead of appearing on the spot.
  collect 14613 quest 5781.1 -- Taelan's Hammer, from Mercutio Filthgorger (57, elite)

